The MCP registry: `MCPServer` and `MCPTool` records, a discovery pass that reconciles a server's advertised tools with the registry, and the `services/mcp.py` client that speaks streamable HTTP and nothing else. Every tool arrives disabled and marked mutating, and stays that way until an operator says otherwise (ADR 0007, Phase 4B rules M1-M5, M8). Nothing calls a tool yet; the agent that will arrives in the next release.
